WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.302
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.703
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.337
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:06.706
Well, it's Wednesday,

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.708
so it's time for Donald Trump's
crime of the week.

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:12.212
What is it this week?

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.146
Did he tie a lady
to some train tracks?

00:00:14.146 --> 00:00:15.548
Did he blow up city hall?

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:19.419
Oh, massive tax fraud,
the old classic.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.720
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.789
New York attorney general
Letitia James today

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.691
filed an over-200-page
civil fraud lawsuit

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:28.194
against former president Trump,
several of his children,

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.529
business partners
in The Trump Organization.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:32.332
I'd say he needs a good lawyer,

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:35.668
but that's been true
for a while now.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.470
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.140
In the new lawsuit filed today,

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.174
New York attorney general
Letitia James

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:44.110
alleges that
The Trump Organization

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.879
deceived lenders, insurers,
and tax officials

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:49.649
by inflating the value
of its properties.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:53.953
Even worse, he listed himself
as 6'7" on his Tinder profile.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.756
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:59.692
President Biden
hosted a reception today

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.261
at New York's American Museum
of Natural History,

00:01:02.261 --> 00:01:05.265
where he also spent some time
catching up with old friends.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.299
"Chompy!"

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:07.533
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.068
"It's been ages, Chompy.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:12.472
Ohh! Oh, God, no, Chompy."

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.574
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:19.712
"What did they do to you,
Chompy?"

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.881
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.784
Russia announced plans
to hold an annexation vote

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.652
in occupied portions of Ukraine.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:28.221
And this is cool --
They also announced

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:30.356
what the results
of the vote will be.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:32.725
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.460
You don't have to stay up late.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.496
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:37.897
According to the latest numbers,

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:40.300
Facebook CEO Mark Zuckerberg's
net worth

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.868
decreased this year
by more than $71 billion.

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.070
No wonder he wants to live
in the metaverse.

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:47.540
He can't afford a place
in San Francisco anymore.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.108
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:51.643
The 22nd annual
Congressional Basketball Game

00:01:51.643 --> 00:01:53.112
was held on Monday night,

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:56.082
and the team of Congress people
beat the team of lobbyists.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:59.586
Or -- just throwing this
out there -- they let you win.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:02.422
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:05.691
A man in Kentucky recently
set a Guinness world record

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:09.729
after driving a mile in reverse
in just over 75 seconds.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:12.632
He then smartly refused
the breathalyzer.

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.803
"Oh, what?
I set a world record?

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:18.338
Alright!"

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:22.809
According to new survey,
3% of Americans

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:25.511
said that they have waited
in a line for over eight hours.

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:28.515
"Well, we're still not opening
a second register,"

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:29.749
said CVS.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.551
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:36.022
And finally, officials
from the CDC said this week

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:39.191
that there was a 26% rise
in syphilis infections

00:02:39.191 --> 00:02:40.192
reported last year.

00:02:40.192 --> 00:02:41.561
Well, good luck with that.

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:44.931
We couldn't even get people
to wear masks.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.265
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:48.434
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

